// Gap 7: an extra argument of a variadic user "extern fun" has to be a type a
// native "va_arg" can read back (an integer, "bool", "f32"/"f64", "str" or an
// opaque handle). An owned "String" is not one, so the call below is a compile
// error naming the argument.
pub extern fun kelp_va_sum(count: i32, ...).return: i32
